---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="About"
  description="Meet Fieldnote Studio: a small independent team creating thoughtful digital experiences."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-20 sm:py-28 lg:px-10">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-forest">A little about us</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 max-w-4xl text-5xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.05em] sm:text-7xl">
      Good things happen when you <span class="text-forest">pay attention.</span>
    </h1>
    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-10 border-t border-ink/10 pt-10 md:grid-cols-[1fr_0.8fr]">
      <p class="text-2xl leading-relaxed tracking-tight">
        Fieldnote is an independent creative studio for people with a point of view and a positive impact.
      </p>
      <div class="space-y-5 leading-7 text-muted">
        <p>We bring strategy, design, and technology together to make digital work feel more human. No layers of process for process's sake—just a thoughtful team, asking good questions and making useful things.</p>
        <p>We believe the best work starts with listening. So we stay curious, keep our team intentionally small, and make every collaboration feel like a real partnership.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="bg-forest text-white">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-8 px-6 py-16 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:px-10">
      <div><p class="text-3xl font-semibold">Curiosity</p><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-white/70">We ask better questions before reaching for easy answers.</p></div>
      <div><p class="text-3xl font-semibold">Clarity</p><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-white/70">We make the complicated feel considered and clear.</p></div>
      <div><p class="text-3xl font-semibold">Care</p><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-white/70">We treat your project—and the people it serves—with intention.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
